<title>USA: Community Trust says reached settlement.</title>
<headline>Community Trust says reached settlement.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Trust Bank N.A. said Friday it had reached settlement in a dispute with a former software vendor which will increase first quarter 1997 earnings by $3.2 million, net of tax.</p>
<p>The settlement will add $4.9 million to income pre-tax, Community Trust said.</p>
<p>Community Trust Bancorp Inc, with $1.8 billion in assets, has offices located in Pikeville, Whitesburg, Ashland, Flemingsburg, Mt. Sterling, Middlesboro, Williamsburg and Versailles and affiliates in Campbellsville and West Liberty.</p>
</text>
